  Title:
    m_Untranslated: Change the Albedo color
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1.</b> Select the <b>Albedo</b> color picker box to open
      the <b>Color Picker window</b>.


      <b>2.</b> In the color wheel, use the
      sliders to select a new color, then take a look at the floor in your Scene
      view!'
